# WebMCP Tools

Tools live in `features/{name}/webmcp/tools/{tool-name}/`:
- `{tool-name}.tool.ts` - tool definition
- `{tool-name}.schema.ts` - Zod input schema

## Rules

- Inject **state** stores, never repositories directly
- Never import UI components
- Shared response helpers: `@core/infrastructure/webmcp/tool-response` (`toolJson`, `toolText`)
- Register globally in `app.config.ts` or route-scoped via `providers: [provideXxxWebMcpTools()]`

```typescript
// ✅ Pattern
export function provideSearchJobsTool(): Provider {
  return {
    provide: WEBMCP_TOOL,
    useFactory: () => {
      const store = inject(JobSearchStore);
      return {
        name: 'search_jobs',
        description: '...',
        inputSchema: searchJobsSchema,
        handler: async (input) => {
          store.search(input.query);
          return toolJson({ count: store.results().length });
        },
      };
    },
  };
}
```

See ADR-002: `docs/decisions/002-feature-colocated-webmcp-tools.md`.
